# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WISHMail
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets. P-13: no private-key material anywhere, ever. `*.env` alone does not
# catch `.env.local` or `.env.testnet`, which is why this is a prefix match with
# the example negated back in.
.env*
!.env.example

# The intent journal: transient, per-machine, and meaningless to anyone else.
app/deployment/*.pending.json

# A Correspondent's HOME DIRECTORY is the agent (D-165): its config carries the
# operator's own key and its keystore carries the agent's. The repository ships
# app/sdk/config.template.json and never a filled one (CLAUDE.md §11), and
# `npm run p13:check` is what keeps a key out of app/ regardless.
.wishmail-*/
*.wishmail-home/
**/keystore.json

# A probe's raw observations. What a probe ESTABLISHED belongs in
# app/OPERATIONS.md, written out, where a reader without the file can follow it;
# the JSON is the working paper and is not kept.
probe542-observations.json

# TypeScript / Node (app/, conformance/)
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# Run logs. Broad on purpose: a provisioning run redirected to a file is the
# ordinary way this project is watched, and none of those belong in the record.
*.log

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
*.swp
